 "finding": "Both ensembles are strongly wired to themselves: the trained ensemble has 30 standard deviations more within-ensemble synapses than random ensembles of the same size, the untrained one 34. An odour-driven Kenyon-cell ensemble is not a random subset of the mushroom body, it is a structural clique. The trained ensemble is the denser of the two, so the comparison is confounded in the direction that would favour a positive result, and any positive must be read with that in mind.",
